59e15d64-e6f6-4e83-af31-6d9e656b7e63	test_user	test_session	user	1234	1234	\N	SELECT\n    po.purchase_id,\n    p.part_number,\n    p.description AS product_category,\n    m.name AS manufacturer_name,\n    po.purchase_quantity,\n    po.actual_unit_cost,\n    (po.purchase_quantity * po.actual_unit_cost) AS total_purchase_amount,\n    po.purchase_date\nFROM\n    purchase_orders po\nJOIN\n    products p ON po.part_number = p.part_number\nJOIN\n    manufacturers m ON po.manufacturer_id = m.manufacturer_id\nWHERE\n    po.purchase_id = 1234	{"final_answer": "🔍 조회된 데이터가 없습니다. 질문의 조건을 확인해 주세요."}	{}	25934	f	2026-03-04 13:32:01.241469+00
