c729460a-60cc-4d47-b7d4-d4b1a00c4c82	test_user	test_session	user	'골든-마진 품목들을 찾아서 판매 실적이 높은 순으로 10개만 나열해줘.	'골든-마진 품목들을 찾아서 판매 실적이 높은 순으로 10개만 나열해줘.	\N	SELECT\n    so.part_number,\n    p.description,\n    SUM(so.sale_quantity * so.actual_selling_price) AS total_sales_performance\nFROM\n    sales_orders AS so\nJOIN\n    products AS p ON so.part_number = p.part_number\nWHERE\n    so.actual_selling_price > p.std_selling_price\nGROUP BY\n    so.part_number,\n    p.description\nORDER BY\n    total_sales_performance DESC\nLIMIT 10	{"final_answer": "네, 요청하신 골든-마진 품목 중 판매 실적이 가장 높은 상위 10개 품목을 알려드립니다.\\n\\n---\\n\\n**판매 실적 상위 10개 골든-마진 품목**\\n\\n1.  **BCM74371CUKFEBA1G** (IC): 83,431,530.00\\n2.  **TLT9255WLC** (C_CHIP/CAP): 82,589,120.00\\n3.  **EP2S30F484C5N** (IC): 80,718,560.00\\n4.  **98DX-BHA1** (IC): 73,463,800.00\\n5.  **LE87281NQCT** (IC): 72,823,680.00\\n6.  **CN5020-300BG564-SCP-G** (IC): 72,762,750.00\\n7.  **A3P250-FGG144** (IC): 72,743,780.00\\n8.  **EPM240M100C4NGA** (IC): 68,296,480.00\\n9.  **A54SX16A-FG144** (IC): 67,651,200.00\\n10. **BCM5482SA1KFB** (IC): 66,108,600.00\\n\\n---\\n\\n더 궁금한 점이나 다른 품목 조회가 필요하시면 언제든지 말씀해주세요."}	{}	10547	f	2026-03-05 01:08:27.857053+00
