4014f86b-62ec-4f69-a09e-7c3c5eefd8b8	test_user	test_session	user	골든-마진 품목들을 찾아서 판매 실적이 높은 순으로 10개만 나열해줘	골든-마진 품목들을 찾아서 판매 실적이 높은 순으로 10개만 나열해줘	\N	SELECT\n    so.part_number,\n    p.description,\n    SUM(so.sale_quantity * so.actual_selling_price) AS total_sales_revenue\nFROM\n    sales_orders AS so\nJOIN\n    products AS p ON so.part_number = p.part_number\nWHERE\n    so.actual_selling_price > p.std_selling_price\nGROUP BY\n    so.part_number, p.description\nORDER BY\n    total_sales_revenue DESC\nLIMIT 10	{"final_answer": "네, 요청하신 골든-마진 품목 중 판매 실적이 높은 상위 10개 품목입니다.\\n\\n---\\n**판매 실적 상위 10개 골든-마진 품목**\\n\\n1.  **BCM74371CUKFEBA1G** (IC): 83,431,530원\\n2.  **TLT9255WLC** (C_CHIP/CAP): 82,589,120원\\n3.  **EP2S30F484C5N** (IC): 80,718,560원\\n4.  **98DX-BHA1** (IC): 73,463,800원\\n5.  **LE87281NQCT** (IC): 72,823,680원\\n6.  **CN5020-300BG564-SCP-G** (IC): 72,762,750원\\n7.  **A3P250-FGG144** (IC): 72,743,780원\\n8.  **EPM240M100C4NGA** (IC): 68,296,480원\\n9.  **A54SX16A-FG144** (IC): 67,651,200원\\n10. **BCM5482SA1KFB** (IC): 66,108,600원\\n---"}	{}	11195	f	2026-03-05 01:13:57.163949+00
